Note on third-party content
----------------------------
* building/RefBldgLargeHotel2004.idf is the DOE Commercial Reference
  Building (Large Hotel) model published by the U.S. Department of
  Energy in the public domain. It is included unmodified.
* building/limassol_*.epw weather files are derived from the Open-Meteo
  ERA5 reanalysis archive, which is also publicly available.
